{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"6cb364953baaa7d07f79a620e677453c8c96e6d334179e889fe4a322874acfe4"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:fd98d4ac0c61f3fc667782e9ca6ffcd5715964edb48e8711bce8b420c345d7bc","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Some popular fantasy and sci-fi series","evidence":"[D17:1 | 3:36 pm on 11 November, 2023] John: Hey Tim! Great to chat again. So much has happened!\n[D17:11 | 3:36 pm on 11 November, 2023] John: Yeah, I saw \"That\"! It's amazing to see those worlds and characters come alive. It's a great way to escape reality!\n[D26:36 | 3:35 pm on 26 December, 2023] Tim: I'm really excited to watch this new show that's coming out called \"The Wheel of Time\". It's based on a book series that I love.","itemId":"urn:uuid:04820ad2-fe6a-58f1-bfab-f12ca8e09882","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c54031678c4ef58752951ecb720f0c846b1bcb20fc9f915b97f1daa79c47ab54","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which TV series does Tim mention watching?","referenceAnswer":"That, Wheel of Time","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c54031678c4ef58752951ecb720f0c846b1bcb20fc9f915b97f1daa79c47ab54"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}